	abstract = {Teloprogramo is an innovative web platform that enhances programming education by leveraging artificial intelli-gence to improve student outcomes. Built on prior technological advancements and research, the platform offers auto-graded exercises for immediate feedback and integrates an AI model trained on introductory Python materials to assist with error detection and correction. A key feature is its gamified approach, where students earn points by solving exercises, which can be used to access AI-based help, fostering engagement. Teloprogramo also provides performance analytics, allowing students and instructors to track progress and refine learning strategies. Users can filter exercises by difficulty, review their attempt history, and tailor their learning. Pilot tests with university students and instructors have shown high success rates and a significant reduction in attempts per problem, demonstrating the platform's effectiveness. With AI-driven personalized feedback and adaptive learning, Teloprogramo offers a powerful solution to transform programming education. © 2024 IEEE.},
